88/</guid><description>为什么美容离不开肩颈，养生首当肩颈？因为肩颈不通畅气血到不了头面部，好比树干受损水份营养滋润不到树叶，肩颈不通畅中枢神经受压，无法通过脑部传</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e7%be%8e%e5%ae%b9%e7%a6%bb%e4%b8%8d%e5%bc%80%e8%82%a9%e9%a2%88%ef%bc%8c%e5%85%bb%e7%94%9f%e9%a6%96%e5%bd%93%e8%82%a9%e9%a2%88.assets/image-20221226150359971.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>养生</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item><item><title>华佗谈养生：湿邪已成健康最大敌人！祛湿才能无病到天年</title><link>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%8D%8E%E4%BD%97%E8%B0%88%E5%85%BB%E7%94%9F%E6%B9%BF%E9%82%AA%E5%B7%B2%E6%88%90%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E6%95%8C%E4%BA%BA%E7%A5%9B%E6%B9%BF%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%97%A0%E7%97%85%E5%88%B0%E5%A4%A9%E5%B9%B4/</link><pubDate>Wed, 22 Mar 2017 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><atom:modified>Wed, 22 Mar 2017 00:00:00 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://www.daoofhealing.org/zh/tcm/%E5%8D%8E%E4%BD%97%E8%B0%88%E5%85%BB%E7%94%9F%E6%B9%BF%E9%82%AA%E5%B7%B2%E6%88%90%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%A7%E6%95%8C%E4%BA%BA%E7%A5%9B%E6%B9%BF%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E6%97%A0%E7%97%85%E5%88%B0%E5%A4%A9%E5%B9%B4/</guid><description>为什么我们现在的科技越来越发达，生活越来越优越，可亚健康的人群和慢性病患者却越来越多呢？ 湿邪是大多数慢性病和疑难杂症的源头或者帮凶！ 行医余年</description><dc:creator>Dao of Healing</dc:creator><media:content url="https://www.daoofhealing.org//img/%e5%8d%8e%e4%bd%97%e8%b0%88%e5%85%bb%e7%94%9f%ef%bc%9a%e6%b9%bf%e9%82%aa%e5%b7%b2%e6%88%90%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e6%9c%80%e5%a4%a7%e6%95%8c%e4%ba%ba%ef%bc%81%e7%a5%9b%e6%b9%bf%e6%89%8d%e8%83%bd%e6%97%a0%e7%97%85%e5%88%b0%e5%a4%a9%e5%b9%b4.assets/image-20221229164557904.png" medium="image"><media:title type="html">featured image</media:title></media:content><category>祛湿</category><category>湿邪</category><category>养生</category><category>中医养生 TCM Health Tips</category><category>养生堂 Health Tutorials</category></item></channel></rss>